        "description": "__Height:__ 170 cm (5&#039;7&quot;)\n\nShion is a main character in the manga and anime No.6. He is kind and understands people. He doesn&#039;t seem amazed by No.6 even though he lives there. He also feels that something about the city is weird - something just feels wrong. Initially, he had brown hair and hazel brown eyes. He has an amazing IQ level, proven by his acceptance into the Special Course.\n\n ~!His appearance changed due to a form of disease he acquired from some substance emitted by a bee in his body.!~",
